Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.18,VO,,0,0,0,,WEDNESDAY. DAY THREE. I HADN'T
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.69,VO,,0,0,0,,BRUSHED MY HAIR SINCE MONDAY,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.78,VO,,0,0,0,,AND SOMETHING TERRIBLE WAS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.83,VO,,0,0,0,,HAPPENING. MAX WAS BEING NICE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.93,0:00:08.53,MAX,,0,0,0,,HEY, SKYE. WANT MY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.40,MAX,,0,0,0,,COOKIE? YOU CAN HAVE IT.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.69,0:00:11.76,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WHAT'S WRONG WITH IT?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.77,0:00:13.58,MAX,,0,0,0,,NOTHING. IT'S A COOKIE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.03,SKYE,,0,0,0,,DID YOU LICK IT?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.09,0:00:17.02,MAX,,0,0,0,,NO! I'M JUST BEING NICE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.04,SKYE,,0,0,0,,SINCE WHEN ARE YOU NICE TO ME?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.56,MAX,,0,0,0,,SINCE A GHOST TOLD ME
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.71,MAX,,0,0,0,,TO. IT'S A LONG STORY.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.90,MAX,,0,0,0,,IT WROTE ON OUR FRIDGE. IN MY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.90,0:00:26.69,MAX,,0,0,0,,LITTLE SISTER'S MAGNET LETTERS.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.89,0:00:27.50,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WOW. SPOOKY. WHAT DID IT SAY?
